{
  "$comment": [
    "Role / machine / controller / welding keyword tables, GENERATED from the live",
    "signals.py objects by scripts (see the PR that added this file) rather than",
    "hand-transcribed. 93 patterns and ten tables retyped by hand is a transcription-error",
    "surface with no upside.",
    "",
    "ORDER IS LOAD-BEARING THROUGHOUT. detect() takes the FIRST keyword match, so a generic",
    "term placed before a specific one shadows it: 'lathe' must not win over 'cnc lathe'.",
    "",
    "THE FIRST COLUMN OF machines/controllers/roles IS A PLAIN KEYWORD; the first column of",
    "roleCues/welding/machiningContext/weldingRoleBlockers/plumbing/carpentry/design/",
    "interiorDesign IS A REGEX SOURCE.",
    "",
    "PRIVACY: these tables derive VOCABULARY_TOKENS, whose only consumer is",
    "pseudonymize.certified_clean_skill_labels — it rescues a label the gateway masked as an",
    "EMPLOYER. Changing a token here changes what the gateway un-masks. The extraction was",
    "proven by asserting the derived frozenset is byte-identical, and a test keeps it so."
  ],
